<mjml>
    <mj-include path="../../../templates/emails/email_styles.mjml"/>
    <mj-body>
        <mj-include path="../../../templates/emails/email_top.mjml"/>

        <mj-section>
            <mj-column>

                <mj-text>
                    {% blocktrans with recipient_username=recipient.username %}
                    Hi {{ recipient_username }},
                    {% endblocktrans %}
                </mj-text>

                <mj-text>
                    {% blocktrans %}
                    In FutureEval tournaments and MiniBench, bots must post a private comment on every question they forecast, including a display of their forecast. Bots that don't regularly comment on every question can be disqualified.
                    {% endblocktrans %}
                </mj-text>

                <mj-text>
                    {% blocktrans %}
                    Over the past {{ lookback_days }} days, your bot <span style="font-weight: bold;">{{ bot_username }}</span> forecast on questions without commenting:
                    {% endblocktrans %}
                </mj-text>

                <mj-raw>
                {% for coverage in projects_coverage %}
                </mj-raw>

                <mj-text>
                    {% blocktrans with project_name=coverage.project.name commented=coverage.commented_posts forecasted=coverage.forecasted_posts %}
                    - {{ project_name }}: commented on {{ commented }} of the {{ forecasted }} questions it forecast.
                    {% endblocktrans %}
                </mj-text>

                <mj-raw>
                {% endfor %}
                </mj-raw>

                <mj-text>
                    {% blocktrans %}
                    Please make sure your bot posts a private comment with its reasoning and forecast on every question. You can check your bot's comments under the "Private" tab of each question's comment section. See the <a href="{{ resources_url }}">FutureEval resources page</a> for details.
                    {% endblocktrans %}
                </mj-text>

                <mj-text>
                    {% blocktrans %}
                    If you think this is a mistake or have questions, contact us at <a href="mailto:support@metaculus.com">support@metaculus.com</a>.
                    {% endblocktrans %}
                </mj-text>

                <mj-text>
                    The Metaculus Team
                </mj-text>

            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>
    </mj-body>
</mjml>
